{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VADE RETRO SATANA</strong> is a retro-inspired RPG in the tradition of classic 80s and 90s role-playing games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience deliberate, turn-based combat with no random encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the war for Heaven, Saint Michael stands against Lucifer, Satan, and all of his minions. It is done...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WILL YOU FIGHT AND CAST THEM ALL INTO THE LAKE OF FIRE? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961220/extras/0f1ea7c060882ebc779a27853050722d.poster.avif?t=1757376797\" width=768 height=768 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961220/extras/0f1ea7c060882ebc779a27853050722d.webm?t=1757376797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961220/extras/0f1ea7c060882ebc779a27853050722d.mp4?t=1757376797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed turn based Solo adventure with Saint Michael against the Devil and his minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art and retro style visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss encounters with Lucifer, Satan, Baal, Beelzebub, Ishtar, Baphomet, and Leviathan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original chiptune soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961220/extras/e63ad669cebc06b3b5768e50c0cc5b66.poster.avif?t=1757376797\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akama